Z||000000||Eric||04-29-2001||06:04 PM||||I'm baaaaaack!  I'm back in the saddle again...<P>It's soo freakin cool.  My 88 GT is running again.  It took a week longer than I thought but I'm very pleased with the results.  Man, I did a lot to this car.  For starters, I freshened the suspension and brakes.  I put poly bushings on everything.  New shocks, new brakes.  Plus I tore off that catoconverti thing.  That was some kind of choke tube.  Now when I open it up, the car actually revs easily beyond 5k rpm.  <P>For looks, the car was dropped an inch or so in front, and the bumpers were painted.  It's so sparkly and nice  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I may even take this thing to a show or two.  ||||reg||1
